\text{If } \Gamma: \Theta \rightrightarrows X \text{ is continuous and compact-valued, and } \varphi \in C(X \times \Theta), \text{ then:} \\
1.\ \varphi^*(\theta) = \max_{x \in \Gamma(\theta)} \varphi(x, \theta) \text{ is continuous on } \Theta. \\
2.\ \sigma(\theta) = \arg\max_{x \in \Gamma(\theta)} \varphi(x, \theta) \text{ is compact-valued and upper hemicontinuous.}
